This directory contains examples for the ProhibitFiletest_rwxRWX 
Perl-Critic policy. The files are:

README - This file.

file-access-tests - This is a script that executes the
    ProhibitFiletest_rwxRWX policy. It is more or less
    equivalent to
    $ perlcritic --single ProhibitFiletest_rwxRWX
    but has its own configuration file. Use
    $ file-access-tests --help
    for the documentation.
